# Copy to .private-terms (gitignored). One extended regex per line, matched
# case-insensitively against every staged file and commit message. Lines starting
# with # are ignored. List what must never appear in this public repo: the origin
# server's public IP, employer and client internals, home-directory paths, keys.
# Not your name, the domain or the tailnet namespace: the site publishes those.
203\.0\.113\.
/home/yourname/
sk-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,}
